Sharpa Wave hand models from Sharpa's sharpa-vision-retargeting-sdk
(https://github.com/sharpa-robotics/sharpa-vision-retargeting-sdk, sharpa-urdf-usd-xml/wave_01),
Copyright 2026 Sharpa Group, licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE in this folder).

The Sharpa meshes in left_meshes/ and right_meshes/ are unmodified. The DexSuite authors modified
left_sharpa_wave_with_flange.urdf, left_sharpa_wave_with_flange.xml, right_sharpa_wave_with_flange.urdf and
right_sharpa_wave_with_flange.xml for use in DexSuite.

right_sharpa_fardexbot.xml is right_sharpa_wave_with_flange.xml plus the wrist-camera mount of the DexSuite
authors' handheld rig (right_meshes/fardexbox_mount_plate.STL, fardexbox_quick_changer.STL and the D405 camera body
fardexbox_d405.STL), added by the DexSuite authors.
